  "title": "东南大学雷恩研究生学院2027年硕士研究生招生简章",
  "html": "<div><div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>东南大学雷恩研究生学院是教育部批准设立的中外合作办学机构，合作办学单位分别为中国东南大学和法国雷恩大学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(Université de Rennes, France)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，许可证编号：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>MOE32FRA02DNR20171839N</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，办学地点：江苏省南京市东南大学九龙湖校区。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>雷恩研究生学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年招收全日制专业学位硕士研究生，并纳入国家下达的研究生招生计划。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>025600</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>资产评估、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085404</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>计算机技术、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085602</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>化学工程、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>035102</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>法律（法学）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、报考条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>符合东南大学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生章程中的报名条件。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、考试和录取</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>符合报考条件的考生须报名参加</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年全国硕士研究生统一入学考试，初试成绩（含总分和单科）须达到</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>雷恩学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>的复试基本要求，方可参加复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试均合格的考生，学院根据招生计划、复试录取工作细则以及考生考试综合成绩、思想政治素质和品德考核情况、身心健康状况等择优确定拟录取名单。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、培养与学位</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>所有专业的学制均为</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年，学费标准为</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>万元</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>·</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学校设立奖助学金，我院全日制硕士生参加奖助学金评定，在学制年限内符合条件的研究生，可参评国家奖学金、学业奖学金等。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>联合培养方案由东南大学和</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>雷恩</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>大学教师共同承担，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>法方</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>课程为英文授课。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学生在规定年限内需修满联合培养方案中的规定学分，成绩合格，满足东南大学相关专业全日制专业学位硕士研究生培养方案的要求并通过硕士学位论文答辩，经东南大学学位评定委员会审核批准后，可获得东南大学硕士研究生毕业证书和专业学位硕士学位证书；经</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>雷恩</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>大学审核批准，可获得</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>雷恩</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>大学硕士学位证书。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>五、信息查询和联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>25</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>52091396</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>徐</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>六、其他未尽事宜参见《东南大学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生章程》</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div></div>",
